{
    title: "HYG-1401 Growing Apples in the Home Orchard",
    author: "Gary Y. Gao, Professor and Small Fruit Specialist, The Ohio State University South Centers, and Courtesy Professor, Department of Horticulture and Crop Science, CFAES, The Ohio State University; and Kass Groner, Undergraduate Student, Department of Horticulture and Crop Science, CFAES, The Ohio State University",
    description:
        "Ohio State Ohioline apple guide for home orchards. The source gives disease-resistant apple cultivars suggested for Ohio, with bloom season, ripening season, disease-resistance notes, uses, and pollination context",
